<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>XML Formatter — DevBox Tools</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Format and validate XML structure online. Check for balanced tags.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/tools/xml-formatter/">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="../../assets/img/favicon.ico?v=1">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="../../assets/img/favicon-32x32.png?v=1">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="../../assets/img/apple-touch-icon.png?v=1">
  <link rel="manifest" href="../../manifest.webmanifest">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/tools/xml-formatter/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="XML Formatter — DevBox Tools">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Format and validate XML structure online.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/assets/img/og-cover.png">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
  <meta name="twitter:url" content="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/tools/xml-formatter/">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="XML Formatter — DevBox Tools">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Format and validate XML structure online.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/css/style.css">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
    "name": "XML Formatter",
    "description": "Format and validate XML structure online.",
    "url": "https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/tools/xml-formatter/",
    "applicationCategory": "DeveloperApplication",
    "operatingSystem": "Any",
    "offers": { "@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "USD" }
  }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="../../" class="logo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 192 192" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="192" height="192" rx="96" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
          <path d="M58 56L88 88L58 120" stroke="white" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
          <path d="M134 56L104 88L134 120" stroke="white" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
        DevBox
      </a>
      <nav>
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="../../">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="../../guides/">Guides</a></li>
          <li><a href="../../developers/">Developers</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="header-actions">
        <button class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme">🌙</button>
        <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="section-title">XML Formatter</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Pretty-print XML and validate balanced tags.</p>

      <div class="tool-layout">
        <div class="tool-main">
          <textarea id="xml-input" placeholder="Paste your XML here..."></textarea>
          <div class="btn-group">
            <button id="btn-format" class="btn">Format</button>
            <button id="btn-validate" class="btn btn-warning">Validate</button>
            <button id="btn-clear" class="btn btn-error">Clear</button>
            <button id="btn-copy" class="btn btn-secondary" data-copy="#xml-output">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;">
            <label style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;">Indentation:</label>
            <select id="indent">
              <option value="2">2 spaces</option>
              <option value="4">4 spaces</option>
              <option value="tab">Tab</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <textarea id="xml-output" readonly placeholder="Output will appear here..."></textarea>
          <div id="xml-message"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-sidebar">
          <div class="sidebar-card">
            <h4>How it works</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);">Paste XML, click Format, and review the pretty-printed output.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sidebar-card">
            <h4>Privacy</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);">🔒 Your data never leaves your device.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="related-tools">
        <h3>Need something else?</h3>
        <a href="../../tools/json-formatter/">JSON Formatter (DevBox)</a>
        <a href="../../tools/code-minifier/">Code Minifier (DevBox)</a>
      </section>

      <section class="faq">
        <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
        <details>
          <summary>Does it handle self-closing tags?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">Yes, self-closing tags like <code>&lt;br/&gt;</code> are preserved during formatting.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can it fix broken XML?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">It can format well-formed XML and will report structural errors. It does not auto-repair broken XML.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What about CDATA sections?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">CDATA sections are preserved as-is during formatting.</div>
        </details>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <div class="privacy-bar">🔒 Your data never leaves your device</div>

  <footer>
    <div class="network-links">
      <p>Part of WebTools Network:</p>
      <a href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/linkqr-tools/">LinkQR Tools — QR & Links</a>
      <a href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/shiftfile-tools/">ShiftFile Tools — File Conversion</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="../../assets/js/app.js"></script>
  <script src="../../assets/js/devbox.sdk.js"></script>
  <script src="../../assets/js/tools/xml-formatter.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
